<title>SWEDEN: BNP Frankfurt buro joins Stockholm bourse.</title>
<headline>BNP Frankfurt buro joins Stockholm bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Stockholm stock exchange said on Tuesday that the Banque Nationale de Paris ' Frankfurt office is to become a remote member of the bourse.</p>
<p>The membership will take effect from April 18, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
